{"at": "2026-09-09T23:46:10.154286+00:00", "event_id": "01M24913KAMRB3Y2VSEDW8FYAE", "event_type": "DecisionPointOpened", "payload": {"actor_id": "cli", "actor_type": "human", "decision_point_id": "01M24913K9HVQR703BFYV2Y9FG", "input_key": "reporting_mechanism", "mission_id": "01M248TNYM7ZBRVQTSFFH7HX1A", "mission_slug": "confirm-dialog-element-01M248TN", "mission_type": "software-dev", "options": ["native close + returnValue", "named custom event"], "origin_flow": "specify", "origin_surface": "planning_interview", "phase": "SPECIFY", "question": "Which single mechanism should sk-confirm-dialog use to report confirm/cancel: the native <dialog> close event with returnValue, or a named custom event?", "recorded_at": "2026-09-09T23:46:10.154286Z", "run_id": "01M24913K9HVQR703BFYV2Y9FG", "state_entered_at": "2026-09-09T23:46:10.153904Z", "step_id": "specify.contract.reporting-mechanism"}}
{"at": "2026-09-09T23:46:23.323034+00:00", "event_id": "01M2491GEV7E7FPEBC0MJ7GTAZ", "event_type": "DecisionPointResolved", "payload": {"actual_participants": [], "closed_locally_while_widened": false, "closure_message": null, "decision_point_id": "01M24913K9HVQR703BFYV2Y9FG", "final_answer": "native close + returnValue: the element funnels every dismissal path (Escape, backdrop click, confirm click, cancel click, programmatic close()) through HTMLDialogElement.close(returnValue), so the platform's own 'close' event is the single observation point; returnValue is 'confirm' or 'cancel'. This avoids adding a second, redundant custom-event contract and keeps the published surface (manifest, ratchets) minimal, per #308's 'chosen and documented explicitly, not half-supported' requirement.", "mission_id": "01M248TNYM7ZBRVQTSFFH7HX1A", "mission_slug": "confirm-dialog-element-01M248TN", "mission_type": "software-dev", "origin_surface": "planning_interview", "other_answer": false, "rationale": null, "recorded_at": "2026-09-09T23:46:23.323034Z", "resolved_by": "cli", "run_id": "01M24913K9HVQR703BFYV2Y9FG", "state_entered_at": "2026-09-09T23:46:23.322563Z", "summary": null, "terminal_outcome": "resolved"}}
{"at": "2026-09-09T23:46:25.061811+00:00", "event_id": "01M2491J55FKRXGT8E1KP5X2V2", "event_type": "DecisionPointOpened", "payload": {"actor_id": "cli", "actor_type": "human", "decision_point_id": "01M2491J55FKRXGT8E1KP5X2V1", "input_key": "static_twin_disposition", "mission_id": "01M248TNYM7ZBRVQTSFFH7HX1A", "mission_slug": "confirm-dialog-element-01M248TN", "mission_type": "software-dev", "options": ["Yes, invent a static form now", "No, defer to #301 ruling"], "origin_flow": "specify", "origin_surface": "planning_interview", "phase": "SPECIFY", "question": "Should sk-confirm-dialog's stylesheet ship a generated static twin for a consumer-rendered <dialog> now, in this mission?", "recorded_at": "2026-09-09T23:46:25.061811Z", "run_id": "01M2491J55FKRXGT8E1KP5X2V1", "state_entered_at": "2026-09-09T23:46:25.061387Z", "step_id": "specify.styles.static-twin"}}
{"at": "2026-09-09T23:46:30.039308+00:00", "event_id": "01M2491Q0Q0NRAB3Y3C9RVC957", "event_type": "DecisionPointResolved", "payload": {"actual_participants": [], "closed_locally_while_widened": false, "closure_message": null, "decision_point_id": "01M2491J55FKRXGT8E1KP5X2V1", "final_answer": null, "mission_id": "01M248TNYM7ZBRVQTSFFH7HX1A", "mission_slug": "confirm-dialog-element-01M248TN", "mission_type": "software-dev", "origin_surface": "planning_interview", "other_answer": false, "rationale": "Issue #308 explicitly instructs: 'if that needs a static twin, follow #301's ruling rather than inventing one here.' #301 (the static-form-of-element-backed-CSS decision) is open and unresolved as of this spec. This mission specifies the stylesheet and element fully and names the static-twin question as a named decision point deferred to #301, per operator/epic #300 instruction. No static form is invented in this mission.", "recorded_at": "2026-09-09T23:46:30.039308Z", "resolved_by": "cli", "run_id": "01M2491J55FKRXGT8E1KP5X2V1", "state_entered_at": "2026-09-09T23:46:30.038845Z", "summary": null, "terminal_outcome": "deferred"}}
